Output docs/assets/demo.gif

Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 15
Set Width 860
Set Height 520
Set Padding 18
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set WindowBar Colorful
Set BorderRadius 8
Set TypingSpeed 40ms

Hide
Type "source /vhs/docs/assets/demo_bashrc"
Enter
Sleep 500ms
Show

Sleep 800ms

Type "subagent doctor"
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 2s

Type "subagent workspaces"
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 2s

Type "subagent opencode 'Review auth flow for token expiry'"
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 2500ms

Type "subagent result --last"
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 3500ms
